  "name": "Arizona One (Arizona flag)",
  "kind": "special",
  "description": "Fuselage: Arizona flag: forward fuselage and lower body royal blue; a large copper/orange five-pointed star on the forward fuselage over the windows; red and yellow alternating sunburst rays fanning back from the star along the upper/mid fuselage; aft fuselage red with yellow lower sections. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Standard Heart fin (blue/red/yellow) with white 'Southwest'. Engines: Blue cowlings with red/orange inner section. Winglets: White. Titles: White 'Southwest' on the lower fin/aft fuselage; 'Arizona One' small by cockpit. Artwork: Arizona flag rays and copper star. Colors hex: approximate.",
